68-69	650,745,1630,1890 - 1545,1360,1590,1392	68. 69. Air-plants of the Orchis family.	Several orchids growing on a short log, their roots clinging to the bark: a large spurred flower above, a long spotted leaf and swollen bulbs at the right, where 68 is printed, and sprays of small flowers hanging below over 69.
